<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῦδος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>glory, renown</i>, esp. in war, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἄν μοι τιμὴν . . καὶ κ. ἄρηαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.84
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ δὲ Διὸς τιμὴ καὶ κ. ὀπηδεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.251
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἕκτορι κ. ὄπαζεν</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀπόλλων</span>) <i><span class="en">
				16.730
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπποτέροισι πατὴρ Ζεὺς κ. ὀρέξῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.33
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἀρέσθαι</span> to win
				<i>glory</i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.407
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύδεϊ γαίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.405
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				5.906
			</span></i>; of a person, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέγα κ. Ἀχαιῶν</span>
			<i>glory</i> of the Achaeans, of Odysseus, <i><span class="en">
				9.673
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.184
			</span></i>; of <i><span class="en">
				Nestor
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.79
			</span></i>.—
				Ep.
			 word, also in <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				23.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.8
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				215
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.89
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				317
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pers.</u>
				455
			</span></i> (not in <i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> or <i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i>); in a mock-heroic line, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				200
			</span></i>; never in 
				Att.
			 Prose.</div>
